          "EUR 700,000 is payable on the ordinary loss, EUR 1,750,000 on the single security loss, and EUR 350,000 on the two uncapped confidentiality losses. The overlapping security claim does not duplicate the same loss, and confidentiality takes precedence for the separate overlapping loss."
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
